  "content": "{section: Verso 1}\n[A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]It's out of my hands making your hands meet\n[A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]Stumbling around it's crumbling out of reach\n[F5] [Bb5] [A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]It's in the cards your destiny your sanity in tow\n\n{section: Refrão 1}\n[F5] [C5] [D5] [A5]Designate my luck\n[F5] [C5]Resignate\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[D5] [A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]This power has no roots to guide, no role\n[A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]Trust me rusted minds refuse to go\n[F5] [Bb5] [A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]Unwillingness, it's meaningless to walk away in vain\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[F5] [C5] [D5] [A5]Designate my will\n[F5] [G5] [D5] [A5]Designate my fill\n[F5] [G5]Resignate\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[D5] [A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]My will is crashing, synapses flashing slow\n[A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]Days like frame by frame, where do they go\n[F5] [Bb5] [A5] [C5] [G5] [B5] [A5]Why fight, forget it, can I spend it after I go\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[E] [F#] [G] [Asus4] [A] [Asus4] [A]Roll them high\n[E] [F#] [G] [Asus4] [A] [Asus4] [A]Throw them again\n[E] [F#] [G]All God's dice"
